WEBVTT

00:03:58.857 --> 00:04:02.531
lakini siku chache baada ya
kupewa dawa mapya,

00:04:02.555 --> 00:04:05.307
maisha yangu yakageuka kuwa
kipindi cha mfu anayetembea.

00:04:06.109 --> 00:04:09.221
Nikawa mtu wa ajabu na kikaanza
kuona vitu ambavyo havipo.

00:04:09.245 --> 00:04:12.269
kwamba maiti zilizooza
zinanijia.

00:04:12.769 --> 00:04:15.611
hatimaye familia yangu ikaninusuru,

00:04:15.635 --> 00:04:20.324
lakini kwa wakati huo, nilipoteza 
paundi 19 katika wiki tatu,

00:04:20.348 --> 00:04:22.777
pamoja na kuanza kuwa na tatizo
la kupungukiwa damu,

00:04:22.801 --> 00:04:24.562
na nilifikia kutaka kujiua.

00:04:26.180 --> 00:04:30.855
Nilienda kwenye kituo kingine cha matibabu
ambacho kilielewa machukizo yangu,